{"name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless 是让云平台按需要运行后端代码、免去自己维护服务器的一种方式。 · 例如用户提交联系表单后，云平台按这次提交运行一段代码，保存内容并发送通知。它不是没有服务器，而是服务器由平台管理；运行多久、能否保留内容和怎样收费仍受平台规则限制。 先知道 后端 Backend 环境变量 Env Var 部署上线 Deployment","quote":"我就一个小功能，不想买服务器也不想运维，有没有按次跑代码的？","agentPrompt":"请用短时无状态 Serverless 函数处理联系表单，校验输入后写入外部存储并发送通知。密钥放平台环境变量，处理重复提交、超时和失败重试；不要依赖函数内存保存长期状态。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-serverless\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Serverless</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">我就一个小功能，不想买服务器也不想运维，有没有按次跑代码的？</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Serverless 是让云平台按需要运行后端代码、免去自己维护服务器的一种方式。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>例如用户提交联系表单后，云平台按这次提交运行一段代码，保存内容并发送通知。它不是没有服务器，而是服务器由平台管理；运行多久、能否保留内容和怎样收费仍受平台规则限制。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/backend?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"backend\">后端 <b>Backend</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/env-var?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"env-var\">环境变量 <b>Env Var</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/deployment?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"deployment\">部署上线 <b>Deployment</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>Serverless 函数</em><em>无服务器计算</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"sl-demo\">\n    <div class=\"sl-io\"><small>请求</small><b>POST /api/contact</b></div>\n    <i class=\"sl-arrow\">→</i>\n    <div class=\"sl-fn\"><b>⚡ 函数</b><small>平台按需启动</small></div>\n    <i class=\"sl-arrow\">→</i>\n    <div class=\"sl-io\"><small>响应</small><b>200 OK</b></div>\n    <span class=\"sl-note\">没有请求时实例为 0 · 按运行次数计费</span>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请用短时无状态 Serverless 函数处理联系表单，校验输入后写入外部存储并发送通知。密钥放平台环境变量，处理重复提交、超时和失败重试；不要依赖函数内存保存长期状态。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">小型网站的 API、表单提交、支付回调和定时任务</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">适合短小、事件驱动的任务</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-boxes\"><span class=\"foundation-box blue\"><small>HTTP</small><b>提交表单</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box orange\"><small>Webhook</small><b>支付回调</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box green\"><small>Cron</small><b>每日汇总</b></span></div>\n  \n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">希望跟随前端一起部署，不想先维护 VPS</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">前端与函数一起部署</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-flow\"><span class=\"foundation-step blue\">git push</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step orange\">构建页面 + API</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step green\">获得网址</span></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-note\">可由平台托管运行环境，仍需管理配置、监控和成本</div>\n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把每个函数设计成短小、无状态、可重复执行</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">状态放到外部服务</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-flow\"><span class=\"foundation-step blue\">请求</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step orange\">短时函数</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step green\">数据库 / 存储</span></div>\n  \n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">在平台设置中配置 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/env-var?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"env-var\" aria-label=\"环境变量 Env Var\">环境变量 <b>Env Var</b></a>，不要写进仓库</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">密钥放平台设置</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-boxes\"><span class=\"foundation-box green\"><small>环境变量</small><b>AI_API_KEY = ••••••••</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box green\"><small>Git 仓库</small><b>不包含密钥</b></span></div>\n  \n</div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">不要把长时间转码或永久连接直接放进短时函数</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">任务时间超过函数上限</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-compare\">\n  <span class=\"\"><small>视频转码</small><b>预计 10 分钟</b></span>\n  <i>→</i>\n  <span class=\"red\"><small>函数上限</small><b>10 秒后超时</b></span>\n</div>\n  \n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">依赖函数内存保存状态：后续请求可能由不同实例处理</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">下一次请求可能换实例</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-compare\">\n  <span class=\"\"><small>实例 A 内存</small><b>count = 8</b></span>\n  <i>→</i>\n  <span class=\"red\"><small>实例 B 内存</small><b>count = 0</b></span>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-note\">需要保留的数据应该写入数据库或缓存</div>\n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">忽略超时、区域、并发和计费限制</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">上线前先看平台限制</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-boxes\"><span class=\"foundation-box orange\"><small>超时</small><b>10s</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box \"><small>区域</small><b>sin1</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box \"><small>并发</small><b>100</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box red\"><small>本月调用</small><b>82%</b></span></div>\n  \n</div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把平台绑定写满业务每一层，未来难以迁移</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"foundation-scene\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-head\">业务逻辑被平台 API 包住</div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-code\"><span>vercel.only.doBusinessRule()</span><span>cloudflare.only.saveOrder()</span></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-note\">平台专用 API 过多会提高迁移或重构核心规则的成本</div>\n</div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"ap mk-tag gray\" data-ap=\"gateway\">平台入口</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"ap mk-tag orange\" data-ap=\"function\">函数实例</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"ap mk-tag green\" data-ap=\"services\">外部状态</span></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"gateway\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">平台入口</span><span class=\"pe\">Gateway</span></button><span class=\"pd\">平台负责网址、HTTPS、扩缩容和请求分发</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"function\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">函数</span><span class=\"pe\">Function</span></button><span class=\"pd\">你的代码只在请求或事件到来时执行</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"services\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">外部状态</span><span class=\"pe\">External State</span></button><span class=\"pd\">持久数据放数据库或存储服务，不依赖函数内存</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Next.js API Route</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"foundation-scene-ui\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-head\"><span>Next.js API Route</span><b>可随前端项目一起发布</b></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-body\"><div class=\"foundation-flow\"><span class=\"foundation-step blue\">git push</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step orange\">平台构建</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step green\">/api/contact 可用</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-foot\">以仓库分支和平台部署配置为准</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">联系表单发送邮件</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"foundation-scene-ui\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-head\"><span>联系表单</span><b>一次请求发送一封邮件</b></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-body\"><div class=\"foundation-ui-form\"><label class=\"foundation-ui-field \"><span>邮箱</span><b>dev@ans.org</b></label><label class=\"foundation-ui-field \"><span>留言</span><b>想了解团队方案</b></label><span class=\"foundation-ui-action blue\">发送</span><div class=\"foundation-boxes\"><span class=\"foundation-box green\"><small>函数结果</small><b>邮件已发送</b></span></div></div></div>\n  \n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">支付平台回调</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"foundation-scene-ui\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-head\"><span>支付回调</span><b>收到平台事件后更新订单</b></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-body\"><div class=\"foundation-flow\"><span class=\"foundation-step blue\">payment.succeeded</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step orange\">验证签名</span><span class=\"foundation-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"foundation-step green\">订单改为已支付</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-foot\">应设计为幂等，避免同一回调重复记账</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">每天运行一次定时任务</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"foundation-scene-ui\">\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-head\"><span>定时任务</span><b>每天自动执行一次汇总</b></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-scene-ui-body\"><div class=\"foundation-boxes\"><span class=\"foundation-box \"><small>计划</small><b>每天 09:00</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box \"><small>动作</small><b>生成昨日数据</b></span><span class=\"foundation-box green\"><small>最近运行</small><b>✓ 12.4s</b></span></div></div>\n  \n</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/serverless","markdown":"# Serverless\n\n你可能会说\n我就一个小功能，不想买服务器也不想运维，有没有按次跑代码的？\n\n**Serverless 是让云平台按需要运行后端代码、免去自己维护服务器的一种方式。**·例如用户提交联系表单后，云平台按这次提交运行一段代码，保存内容并发送通知。它不是没有服务器，而是服务器由平台管理；运行多久、能否保留内容和怎样收费仍受平台规则限制。\n先知道\n[后端 **Backend**](/vibe-hub/backend?lang=zh)[环境变量 **Env Var**](/vibe-hub/env-var?lang=zh)[部署上线 **Deployment**](/vibe-hub/deployment?lang=zh)\n\n也常被叫作Serverless 函数无服务器计算\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请用短时无状态 Serverless 函数处理联系表单，校验输入后写入外部存储并发送通知。密钥放平台环境变量，处理重复提交、超时和失败重试；不要依赖函数内存保存长期状态。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- 小型网站的 API、表单提交、支付回调和定时任务\n\n适合短小、事件驱动的任务\n\n  \nHTTP**提交表单**Webhook**支付回调**Cron**每日汇总**\n- 希望跟随前端一起部署，不想先维护 VPS\n\n前端与函数一起部署\n\n  \ngit push→构建页面 + API→获得网址\n\n  \n可由平台托管运行环境，仍需管理配置、监控和成本\n- 把每个函数设计成短小、无状态、可重复执行\n\n状态放到外部服务\n\n  \n请求→短时函数→数据库 / 存储\n- 在平台设置中配置 [环境变量 **Env Var**](/vibe-hub/env-var?lang=zh)，不要写进仓库\n\n密钥放平台设置\n\n  \n环境变量**AI_API_KEY = ••••••••**Git 仓库**不包含密钥**\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 不要把长时间转码或永久连接直接放进短时函数\n\n任务时间超过函数上限\n\n  \n视频转码**预计 10 分钟**\n  →\n  函数上限**10 秒后超时**\n- 依赖函数内存保存状态：后续请求可能由不同实例处理\n\n下一次请求可能换实例\n\n  \n实例 A 内存**count = 8**\n  →\n  实例 B 内存**count = 0**\n\n  \n需要保留的数据应该写入数据库或缓存\n- 忽略超时、区域、并发和计费限制\n\n上线前先看平台限制\n\n  \n超时**10s**区域**sin1**并发**100**本月调用**82%**\n- 把平台绑定写满业务每一层，未来难以迁移\n\n业务逻辑被平台 API 包住\n\n  \nvercel.only.doBusinessRule()cloudflare.only.saveOrder()\n\n  \n平台专用 API 过多会提高迁移或重构核心规则的成本\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n平台入口→函数实例→外部状态\n\n1平台入口Gateway平台负责网址、HTTPS、扩缩容和请求分发\n\n2函数Function你的代码只在请求或事件到来时执行\n\n3外部状态External State持久数据放数据库或存储服务，不依赖函数内存\n\n典型使用场景\n\nNext.js API Route\n\nNext.js API Route**可随前端项目一起发布**\n\n  \ngit push→平台构建→/api/contact 可用\n\n  \n以仓库分支和平台部署配置为准\n\n联系表单发送邮件\n\n联系表单**一次请求发送一封邮件**\n\n  \n邮箱**dev@ans.org**留言**想了解团队方案**发送\n函数结果**邮件已发送**\n\n支付平台回调\n\n支付回调**收到平台事件后更新订单**\n\n  \npayment.succeeded→验证签名→订单改为已支付\n\n  \n应设计为幂等，避免同一回调重复记账\n\n每天运行一次定时任务\n\n定时任务**每天自动执行一次汇总**\n\n  \n计划**每天 09:00**动作**生成昨日数据**最近运行**✓ 12.4s**"}